"A true, true friend helps a friend in need to see the light that shines from a true, true friend" 𑣲🫂🧡⋆˚࿔

So cool that I was able to cover this song together with actual friends! When I covered it for the first time solo 10 years ago, I doubt I thought about ever getting to this point so much later XDD Really happy about it though.

Thanks to everypony that joined me on this! It was such a pleasure to have you. I really like how we sound together. ^^

Have fun watching the video! Stay awesome. Bye!

