"Winter Wrap Up, Winter Wrap Up, 'cause tomorrow spring is here." ❄️🌷🐎

This was a cover I just had to get to at some point. I feel like every mlp cover artist has at this point and for good reason: THIS SONG IS A BANGER! Daniel Ingram created such a catchy masterpiece.

So yeah, I am happy to finally get this out and sing Winter Wrap Up with seven friends of mine. They all did a great job with their recordings! This wouldn't be the same without you guys :D

The mixing wasn't too much of a problem, except that it took quite a while to align everyone (as always with group covers XD). For the art I went with the g4 style, because it felt right and was easier for this case.

I hope you all enjoy! Let us welcome spring now that winter is over. ^^

Till next time! Stay awesome! Bye.


