"Giddyup, derby racers - Go, go, go!" 🏎️🏁

Hello to a new mlp group cover! I know it has been a while since the last one, but there are just so many covers I wanna do. Still mlp will never vanish from my channel, hehe ;)

Now I thank everyone that joined me on this Cover! I had wanted to do Derby Racers for quite a while. I have always liked this song and now I was finally able to bring out my own version with the help of my friends. Such fun!

The art took me quite a while, especially since I had never drawn carts or helmets for ponies. Chose to use the same ones as in the show to make it a little easier for myself.

I definitely enjoyed mixing this one with how talented every singer here is! I think it turned out really well and hope you all like it too!

Till next time! Stay awesome! Bye.


