"A party to be proud of, a day of games and fun! Just you wait and see: A magic day in perfect harmony!"🎈🎂🎶


Happy 23rd birthday to me! I welcome you all to my biggest Cover yet!!!

This one took a lot of preparation and work, but I really like how it came out. It had started with me asking about which of two Group Covers I should do next  three months ago from when I am uploading this. Now we are here with "We Got This Together" from the My Little Pony G4 Movie!

The song got me so hyped when I first saw it in cinema exactly seven years ago on my 16th birthday. Can't believe it has been so long since it came out...

Anyway I am joined by a group of amazing people from my Discord Server. Some of which had not ever been in any Cover before this one. I am real proud of em all and how well everyone did in general. Thanks for joining!!!

The mixing was a little bit of a struggle, but in the end I made it work and am satisfied. That's what matters. I did get a little stressed out with art and editing, since there was so much to do, though I guess that is fitting, since I sing as Twilight in this. Thanks to my best friend @MelodySnowflakeVA for reassuring me that it would all be alright in the end.

I am also thankful to @xxmyawolfxx for drawing four of the headshots for the cover. That did really help me, especially since other artists I had on the project at first could not finish their part in the end. I understand how busy life can get though.

All in all it worked out in the end and now the Cover is out. I hadn't planed to get it out on my birthday and only decided on it two days beforehand, but it is really fitting honestly.

We all got this together and I thank you all for helping, watching, and even reading this ramble of mine. I truly mean it when I say...STAY AWESOME!


