"We'll make our mark! Show the world what we can do. We'll make our mark! 
Helping fillies to break through to the ultimate reward of a cutie mark." 🎉✅🐎

Hello! Here is another Pony Collab Cover! This time of the song "We'll Make Our Mark". It was suggested by @DashaMoone_Cetha and I am happy to be able to finally show it to you all.

If I had known there is a version that includes Diamond Tiara before making this, I would have included her, but oh well. Still think this turned out great! Everyone sang so well and I like how all the harmonies sound together. Art was fun to draw for it too. Kept it in show-style this time.

The episode the song originated from - "Crusaders of the Lost Mark" - was such a special one. Wanted to cover songs from it for a long time, since it to this day is still one of my favourites from the whole show. It just invokes such good feelings. So proud of the CMC for getting the marks they searched for for so long and on top of that it's a musical episodes. (Those are the best from my point of view, haha)

Enjoy the Cover and make your mark in the comments by writing something in there! Stay awesome! Bye. ^^


