Thanks a lot to everyone that joined me in this and especially @Jo_Pym for not only doing a great job as Captain Calaeno, but also helping me with the art! This is the first time ever I had another artist help me with art for a collab like this, but I love how it turned out.

I hope everyone enjoys this group cover! Stay awesome! Bye.


