"Make a rainbow and you will see, how together we are like one when we harmonize!"


Hello everypony! 

Today I present to you my Collab Cover of "Living In Color"! This is a song I wanted to do for a long time and I couldn't be happier to have all these amazing singers helping me out with it. 

I find it pretty cool to have had the luck of getting people to join, that had ocs including all the colors of the rainbow. It really fits the song and it's message of how everyone should be proud of who they are. Each person their unique color and all together we can make a pretty rainbow and the world a better place, haha.

I am really happy with how this video turned out and thanks to everyone who lend their voice to this project. I really appreciate it! 

Hope you all out there can enjoy this and have a fantastic day. Stay awesome and colorful! Bye!


