Without love it cannot be seen.
! This video includes background image spoilers for Umineko no Naku Koro Ni

I've been staring at the description for a while, thinking about what to say, but the truth is I don't know. Sometimes you encounter something that you knew existed but did not engage with before at just the right moment. I expected nothing from Umineko, and what I got were a lot of beautiful words I didn't know I needed to hear. In other words, witches are awesome.

Thank you to all the wonderful people who have worked on this with me, you did amazing. Thank you to the people who have created this beautiful piece of media, you did amazing. Thank you to those who share art with others who would not have known otherwise, you did amazing. And thank you for listening... You know the line. 🧙💚

